<title>SWEDEN: SWIMMING-REIGNING WORLD SHORT-COURSE CHAMPIONS.</title>
<headline>SWIMMING-REIGNING WORLD SHORT-COURSE CHAMPIONS.</headline>
<dateline>GOTHENBURG, Sweden 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reigning champions</p>
<p>from the world short-course swimming championships held in Rio</p>
<p>de Janeiro from November 30 to December 3, 1995 (*denotes</p>
<p>individual champions defending their titles at the third world</p>
<p>short-course championshinps beginning on Thursday:</p>
<p>Men</p>
